        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩtina wa maũndũ aa nĩnoonie, na sisya, mũomo ũvingũkĩte ĩtunĩ, na wasya wa mbee ũla neewie, ta wasya wa soo ũineena nakwa, ũmwe akyasya, Ambata kũũ, nakwa ngakwon’ya maũndũ ala mate ndĩi kwĩkĩka ĩtina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
